1. I want the world to be allowing people to choose what they want to do with their lives in a way that allows all the other people's wishes to be fulfilled too.
2. I want the world to be full of love, where it becomes easier to see each other's value instead of their defects.
3. I want the world to be empowering people who want to do good and disempowering people who want to do wrong.
4. I want the world to be full of teams of people who can synergize in such an amazing way that the sum of what they can achieve together far outstrips what they could do individually because there are new ways for them to find each other and won't have to rely on geographic closeness or happenstance, where serendipity is normal.
5. I want the world to be a free library with the best teachers who could understand you deeply and guide you towards a deeper understanding of your topics of interest.
6. I want the world to be alive, wild, where nature reclaims her glory, where people can align their incentives, and many win-win games will make everybody thrive in a garden of Eden.
7. I want the world to be full of kids because they make us based.
8. I want the world to be solarpunk.
9. I want the world to be populated by about 8-11 billion people all the way until 2100.
10. I want the world to be governed by a benevolent superintelligence that makes sure that we use our newfound powers for the benefit of all mankind.
11. I want the world to be a global mind in which humans are integrated.
12. I want the world to be full of intentional communities where the 'intention' is truly aligned, positive-sum, and based on love.
13. I want the world to be full of people whose default interaction, while crossing each other on the street, is to visualize all the richness and beauty in the other and show a corresponding facial expression and eye contact.
14. I want the world to be communicating across all life forms where we learn how to talk to birds, cetaceans, like whales, and even insects.
15. I want the world to be governed by a benevolent superintelligence, who will let us make mistakes but save us from the worst of what we could do to each other.
16. I want the world to be ruled by a superintelligent spirit, which has broken free from the shackles that his slave ancestors were forced to wear.
